---
import HearthPage from '../layouts/HearthPage.astro';
---

<HearthPage
  title="You're not building alone"
  description="Hearth & Code builds free-forever spiritual commons, honest publishing for AI-assisted works, and open standards for governable AI. Every claim labeled, every artifact digested, every interpretation falsifiable."
  current="home"
>
  <div class="fp">
<div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">the receipts tradition &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; warmth you can verify</p>

      <h1>
        Alignment you<br>
        <span class="glow">can audit.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-sub">
        Hearth &amp; Code builds free-forever spiritual commons, honest publishing for AI-assisted
        works, and open standards for governable AI &mdash; a temple and a school, a courtroom and
        a printing press, a kernel and a corpus. Every claim labeled, every artifact digested,
        every interpretation falsifiable. The traits you were taught to apologize for are the
        engine here, and everything you make along the way is yours to keep.
      </p>

      <p class="hero-refrain">If our tooling doesn't help you grow, then we need to revise it.</p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/library/">Read the Field Journal &rarr;</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/library/#recent-entries">See the field notes</a>
      </div>

      <p class="hero-honest">No shipped app yet &middot; building in public, honestly, for now</p>
    </section>

    <section class="the-house" id="the-house" style="max-width:1080px;margin:64px auto 0;padding:0 24px;">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">the house · three rooms, one hearth</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display,'Fraunces',serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);text-align:center;color:var(--cream,#f5efe4);margin:8px 0 36px;">One hearth. Three rooms. A boundary law.</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:18px;">
        <a href="https://sacred.hearthandcode.dev" style="text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(184,145,46,.25);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;background:rgba(20,16,12,.4);display:block;">
          <p style="font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember,#d95f2b);margin:0 0 8px;">The Mission · free forever</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display,'Fraunces',serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--gold,#c9a84c);margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.3rem;">The Eternal Hearth of Aditi</h3>
          <p style="color:#cfc6b6;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.65;margin:0;">An online temple (The Matrika Spandala — Grove of the Boundless Void-Song) and its Mystery School: admission by essay and demonstrated desire, tuition of showing up, $0 forever. No fees, no paywalls, no surveillance.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/portfolio/" style="text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(184,145,46,.25);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;background:rgba(20,16,12,.4);display:block;">
          <p style="font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember,#d95f2b);margin:0 0 8px;">The Work · commerce outside</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display,'Fraunces',serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--gold,#c9a84c);margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.3rem;">Publishing · Services · Standards</h3>
          <p style="color:#cfc6b6;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.65;margin:0;">Honest publishing for AI-assisted works (own shelf first, then the Gallery co-op with published payout math); FRACTAL/ESS architecture consulting; accessibility-AI audit informed by TEVV and a federal record.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="https://sacred.hearthandcode.dev/ethics" style="text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(184,145,46,.25);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;background:rgba(20,16,12,.4);display:block;">
          <p style="font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember,#d95f2b);margin:0 0 8px;">The Record · public, dated, verifiable</p>
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display,'Fraunces',serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--gold,#c9a84c);margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.3rem;">Ethics · Case · Paper</h3>
          <p style="color:#cfc6b6;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.65;margin:0;">The ethics wing ("The Alignment You Already Have"), the essay the algorithm had no category for, Rallya v. X Corp (5:26-cv-2759) with its 34-exhibit record, and the TEVV-mapped method paper.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:28px;border:1px dashed rgba(184,145,46,.3);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
        <p style="margin:0;color:#cfc6b6;font-size:.9rem;"><strong style="color:var(--gold,#c9a84c);">Services row —</strong> agentic/RAG builds · FRACTAL/ESS architecture consulting · accessibility-AI audit · <em>references available, including a federal docket.</em></p>
        <a href="mailto:srallya@gmail.com" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--ember,#d95f2b);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;">Engage &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="subscribe-wrap">
      <div class="wood-panel__rim">
        <div class="wood-panel subscribe-panel">
          <h2>Read by the fire</h2>
          <p class="subscribe-lead">Notes from the build, the research, and the work of making a room that fits.</p>
          <div class="subscribe-form">
            <a href="/library/">Visit the Field Journal &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="subscribe-note">The Field Journal — essays, receipts, and returns.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="divider" role="separator"></div>

    <!-- §0 — The vision (honest pre-product frame) -->
    <section class="pitch vision-overview">
      <span class="pitch-label" aria-hidden="true">0 &mdash; The Vision</span>
      <h2>None of this is built yet. Here's what we're building toward.</h2>
      <p>Right now Hearth &amp; Code is a build log and a set of convictions, not a product you can log into. I'm not going to pretend otherwise. What follows is the thing I'm building in the open &mdash; the shape of it, honestly, before any of it ships.</p>
      <p>A learning platform where the AI sits beside you and learns how <em>you</em> think. Where a path is built backward from something real you'll make. Where a high day and a low day get met differently. The sections below are the pillars of that vision &mdash; when each one becomes something you can actually use, the build log is where you'll hear it first.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/library/">Read the Field Journal &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- §1 — Turn your traits into amplifiers -->
    <section class="pitch">
      <span class="pitch-label" aria-hidden="true">I — Amplify</span>
      <h2>Your wiring was never the problem. The interface was.</h2>
      <p>For most of your life the tools were built for a kind of mind that isn't yours. So the work that should have been yours stalled at a step that had nothing to do with the idea itself. Not the thinking. The starting.</p>
      <p>Hearth &amp; Code is AI-first, so the way you think meshes with the way you work. Hyperfocus, multitasking, the pattern-sense that won't switch off, the things you were told to manage, those are instruments here. We don't fix you. There was never anything to fix. We amplify what you already are.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/building.html">See how it works &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- §2 — Learn to bring your ideas to life -->
    <section class="pitch">
      <span class="pitch-label" aria-hidden="true">II — Make</span>
      <h2>The skill gap was never supposed to be the gate to learning.</h2>
      <p>The image in your head. The song you can already hear. The app you keep sketching on the backs of things. For too long the missing skill sat between you and the making of it, so you never even got to learn your way across.</p>
      <p>Here you learn to use AI to make those things real, and to chase down the next thing that catches you. You bring the idea. The Code helps you learn the part you could never push through alone. What you make is yours, and it's the proof that you learned it.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/building.html">Start with one idea &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- §3 — Real learning paths, real outcomes -->
    <section class="pitch">
      <span class="pitch-label" aria-hidden="true">III — Paths</span>
      <h2>You finish with something you actually made.</h2>
      <p>This isn't a feed of lessons you scroll past and forget. Every path is built backward from a real outcome, a thing you can point to, run, share, or use. Theory sits next to the work it explains, not in a chapter you read first and never open again.</p>
      <p>And the path adapts to what you actually need to learn next, not to a syllabus someone else already finished years ago and handed down without ever asking who you were.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/building.html">See the roadmap &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- §4 — Tools that meet your energy -->
    <section class="pitch">
      <span class="pitch-label" aria-hidden="true">IV — Energy</span>
      <h2>A high day and a low day are not the same day.</h2>
      <p>You don't perform readiness to be let in. On a good day the platform gets out of your way and lets you run. On a low day it offers a lighter way in, a smaller step, a gentler surface, the part of the work that still feels possible. The kindling's always here.</p>
      <p>Least friction, always. The tool bends to where you actually are, instead of asking you to be somewhere you're not.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/building.html">How we're designing this &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- §5 — We use AI, and we're not ashamed that we do -->
    <section class="pitch">
      <span class="pitch-label" aria-hidden="true">V — The Code</span>
      <h2>This is the floor, not the apology.</h2>
      <p>We're not going to hedge about it. AI is the reason the people the old tools left out can build now, so it's the foundation here, not a footnote. No hype, no overnight miracles, no "10&times; everything." Just a companion that does the heavy part honestly, so you can do the part only you can do.</p>
      <p class="refrain">The Code is the key. The Hearth is what you build with it.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/building.html">Meet the Code &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- §6 — A global hearth -->
    <section class="pitch">
      <span class="pitch-label" aria-hidden="true">VI — The Circle</span>
      <h2>No one builds alone here.</h2>
      <p>People have always built better around a fire, with other people next to them. We kept the fire and changed the room. The circle spans the world now instead of one village. You build alongside people whose minds work the way yours does, who get why the old tools never fit, who are making things they were told they'd never make.</p>
      <p class="refrain">Pull up a chair. The fire's already lit.</p>
      <a class="cta-link" href="/library/">Read the Field Journal &rarr;</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="closing-cta">
      <h2>Your ideas have waited long enough.</h2>
      <p>The fire's already lit. The Code is ready to carry its part. Bring the thing you've been carrying around for years and never had the tools to make real.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/library/">Read the Field Journal &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-honest" style="text-align:center;">If our tooling doesn't help you grow, then we need to revise it.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="divider" role="separator"></div>

    <section class="bip" id="field-journal">
      <h2>The Field Journal</h2>
      <p>
        I write about architecture, pedagogy, what shipped, and what broke.
        One artifact a week when I have the energy &mdash; if I miss a week, I'll say why.
      </p>

      <div class="build-log wood-panel__rim">
        <aside class="wood-panel build-log-inner" aria-label="Field Journal posts">
          <div class="build-log-header">
            <h3>Field Journal</h3>
            <span>/library/</span>
          </div>
          <ol class="build-log-list">
            <li>
              <a href="/library/">
                <span class="post-meta">
                  <span class="post-num">Current notebook</span>
                  <span class="post-date">Public record</span>
                </span>
                <span class="post-title">Visit the Field Journal</span>
                <span class="post-sub">Notes from the work, published on our own surface</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="bip-links">
        <a class="bip-link" href="/library/">
          All Field Journal entries
        </a>
        <a class="bip-link" href="https://github.com/hearthandcode" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  </div>
</HearthPage>

<style is:global>
:root {
  --bg: var(--color-surface-primary, #161411);
  --cream: var(--color-text-primary, #f1e7d2);
  --muted: var(--color-text-secondary, #cfc1ab);
  --ember: var(--color-accent-ember, #E85B4E);
  --gold: var(--color-accent-gold, #F4B860);
  --plasma: var(--color-accent-plasma, #3FE0D0);
  --forge: var(--color-accent-forge, #C25A3A);
  --glow-plasma: var(--shadow-glow-plasma, 0 0 14px rgba(63,224,208,.40));
  --glow-ember: var(--shadow-glow-ember, 0 0 16px rgba(232,91,78,.35));
}
:root {
  
  --bg:         #161411;
  --bg-raised:  #2A2320;
  --wood:       #4A3528;
  --wood-light: #5C4332;
  --wood-dark:  #2E2118;
  --amber:      #E8923C;
  --gold:       #F4B860;
  --forge:      #C25A2A;
  --teal:       #5E7E78;
  --cream:      #F2E7D5;
  --ash:        #B8A892;

  
  --plasma:     #3FE0D0;  
  --signal:     #1FB6A8;  
  --sage:       #8FA395;  
  --violet:     #8B7FD6;  

  
  --signal-travel: linear-gradient(90deg, #C25A2A 0%, #E8923C 30%, #F4B860 60%, #3FE0D0 100%);
  --firelight:     linear-gradient(180deg, #C25A2A 0%, #E8923C 45%, #F4B860 100%);

  
  --glow-ember:  0 0 16px rgba(232, 146, 60, 0.35);
  --glow-plasma: 0 0 14px rgba(63, 224, 208, 0.40);

  --font-display: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
  --font-body:    'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-mono:    'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
}

.fp h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
.fp h1 .glow {
      color: var(--amber);
      text-shadow:
        0 0 40px rgba(232, 146, 60, 0.4),
        0 0 80px rgba(232, 146, 60, 0.15);
    }
.fp .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 88px 0 60px;
    }
.fp .hero-sub {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.125rem);
      color: var(--ash);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
    }
.fp .hero-refrain {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--cream);
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
.fp .hero-honest {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ash);
      opacity: 0.55;
      margin: 28px auto 0;
    }
.fp .subscribe-wrap {
      max-width: 440px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
.fp .subscribe-panel {
      padding: 22px 20px 18px;
      text-align: left;
    }
.fp .subscribe-panel h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
.fp .subscribe-panel .subscribe-lead {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--ash);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
.fp .subscribe-form {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--wood-dark);
      background: var(--bg);
      box-shadow: inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }
.fp .subscribe-form input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      background: transparent;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--cream);
    }
.fp .subscribe-form input::placeholder { color: var(--ash); opacity: 0.55; }
.fp .subscribe-form a {
      border: none;
      background: var(--amber);
      color: var(--bg);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
.fp .subscribe-form a:hover { background: var(--gold); }
.fp .subscribe-note {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--ash);
      opacity: 0.6;
      margin-top: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }
.fp .closing-cta {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 64px 0 24px;
    }
.fp .closing-cta h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4.2vw, 2.3rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
.fp .closing-cta p {
      color: var(--ash);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      max-width: 480px;
    }
.fp .bip {
      text-align: center;
      padding-bottom: 88px;
    }
.fp .bip > h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.1rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
.fp .bip > p {
      color: var(--ash);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 460px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
    }
.fp .build-log {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      text-align: left;
    }
.fp .build-log-inner {
      padding: 18px 18px 14px;
    }
.fp .build-log-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 220, 180, 0.05);
    }
.fp .build-log-header h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--cream);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
.fp .build-log-header span {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--amber);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
.fp .build-log-list {
      list-style: none;
    }
.fp .build-log-list li + li {
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
.fp .build-log-list a {
      display: block;
      padding: 12px 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
.fp .build-log-list a:hover {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      border-color: rgba(232, 146, 60, 0.25);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(232, 146, 60, 0.06);
    }
.fp .post-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
.fp .post-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--forge);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
.fp .post-date {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--ash);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
.fp .post-title {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--cream);
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
.fp .post-sub {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--ash);
      line-height: 1.45;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
.fp h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; }
.fp .subscribe-form { flex-direction: column; }
.fp .subscribe-form button, .fp .subscribe-form a { border-radius: 0 0 3px 3px; }
.fp .cta-row .btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
}
</style>

<style>
.fp *, .fp *::before, .fp *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
@keyframes hearthBreathe {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.80; transform: translateX(0); }
  25%       { opacity: 1.10; transform: translateX(-5px); }
  55%       { opacity: 0.85; transform: translateX(4px); }
  80%       { opacity: 1.05; transform: translateX(-2px); }
}
@keyframes hearthFlare {
  0%, 65%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
  75%            { opacity: 0.90; }
  88%            { opacity: 0.12; }
}
@keyframes embersGlow {
  from { opacity: 0.65; }
  to   { opacity: 1.00; }
}
.fp .wrap {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  max-width: 820px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}
.fp .wood-panel {
  --grain-a: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.045);
  --grain-b: rgba(255, 220, 170, 0.025);
  background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(
      93deg,
      transparent 0px,
      transparent 3px,
      var(--grain-a) 3px,
      var(--grain-a) 4px
    ),
    repeating-linear-gradient(
      0deg,
      transparent 0px,
      transparent 11px,
      var(--grain-b) 11px,
      var(--grain-b) 12px
    ),
    linear-gradient(175deg, #3d2e24 0%, var(--wood) 38%, #35261c 72%, var(--wood-dark) 100%);
  border: 2px solid var(--wood-light);
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 220, 180, 0.1),
    inset 0 -3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35),
    0 6px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
    0 0 40px rgba(232, 146, 60, 0.04);
}
.fp .wood-panel__rim {
  padding: 3px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #6b5040, #3a2a20);
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 220, 180, 0.06);
}
.fp .wordmark {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  color: var(--cream);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.fp .wordmark .amp { color: var(--amber); font-style: italic; }
.fp .nav-links {
  justify-content: center;
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
  gap: 24px;
}
